    <h1 class="about__title">About</h1>

    <div class="about__bio">
      <p>
        WRONGORIGIN is an audiovisual entity concerned with in-between spaces —
        occurrences that should have taken place in your american dream —
        the hours, places, and moments that exist at the edges of the world.
      </p>
      <p>
        Frames taken in places that toll roads and fossil fuel industry
        monopolized highways won't take you. Decentralized snippets of realities
        other than those found at the starting point.
      </p>
      <p>
        Current works span documentaries, architecture, and portraiture.<br/>
        Based between DFW and wherever the next shot is taken.
      </p>
      <p>Available for editorial, commercial, and personal projects.</p>
